<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 800s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 9th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 800s BCE, 211 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 54 were founded and 7 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Assyrian Empire, the Western Zhou and the State of Qin.</p></header>
